      "The background, line and marker colours are fixed at 7, 4 and 8.",
      "The _sample_shape fallback after 60 attempts recolours the spine column with random colours. It is correct but visually less structured, and is expected to be rare.",
      "Relies on common.grid(width, height, color) returning height rows of width cells, as documented.",
      "Sampled agreement and shape controls do not prove complete coverage of all valid scenes."
